@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071

### List releases
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/releases?project=release-notes

### Missing release
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/releases/missing?projectId=release-notes

### Dependency health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Compile locally in Development; hosted callers supply their Entra bearer token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/releases/compile
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organization": "contoso",
  "project": "release-notes",
  "repositoryId": "repository-id",
  "buildId": 42
}